# API routes

- Keep route handlers thin: validate input, authorize, delegate to services.
- Return structured JSON errors with appropriate status codes.
- Verify webhook signatures before processing payloads.
- Use admin Supabase client only in trusted webhook/cron handlers.

```typescript
export async function POST(request: Request) {
  const body = await request.json();
  const parsed = schema.safeParse(body);
  if (!parsed.success) {
    return NextResponse.json({ error: "Invalid input" }, { status: 400 });
  }
  // delegate to service...
}
```
